{"id":"steam-1386830","steam":1386830,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Daffodil Yellow: A few poems from an insect collector","summary":"You are an insect collector. Wander through old summer memories looking for colors.","about":"“Daffodil Yellow: a few poems from an insect collector” is a 3D game/interactive experience about the reconciliation between someone and a season.\r\n\r\nThe story takes place at the very beginning of summer. This season makes the collector see everything in black and white. One day, after taking a nap, he turns into a butterfly.\r\n\r\nHe will go through three memories that are dear to him, which took place during previous summers. Looking for a color in each of them, he will repaint his current summer. \r\n\r\nEach memory, each flower, each color has a meaning, creating an ambience through the music and the visuals. \r\n\r\nAn abstract story without words, this project is about the different translations of a feeling. A precise feeling, told as visuals, sound, text and interactions through a 15-20 minute long experience.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/library_600x900.jpg?t=1646230814","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/header.jpg?t=1646230814","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/library_hero.jpg?t=1646230814","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/header.jpg?t=1646230814","background":null,"screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/ss_9797206dd1a9aaa3533afd479156d21575ef4a39.600x338.jpg?t=1646230814","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/ss_9797206dd1a9aaa3533afd479156d21575ef4a39.jpg?t=1646230814"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1386830/ss_96209b5f0fae6fce08977c3470538ac4e3e7147a.600x338